<title>USA: Cross-Continent Auto names Purser CFO.</title>
<headline>Cross-Continent Auto names Purser CFO.</headline>
<dateline>AMARILLO, Texas 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cross-Continent Auto Retailers Inc said Thursday it had named James Purser chief financial officer, effective March 8.</p>
<p>He will be also appointed to the board of directors.</p>
<p>Purser, 46, joins Cross-Continent from Atmos Energy Corp, where he was executive vice president and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Cross-Continent said Purser's experience will assist it in its strategy of acquiring additional dealerships.</p>
<p>He succeeds Charles Winton, who becomes chief accounting officer.</p>
</text>
